  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Armies of the Lord**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Need More Bandages**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Charlie Sheen Reaches Out to the Feds**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Dawn of Revelation**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Slow West Vultures**: back after 54 archived shows (894 days) [2]\n- **Alpha Rats Nest**: back after 38 archived shows (810 days) [2]\n- **Horseradish Road**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Going to Michigan**: back after 152 archived shows (2358 days); rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2026-05-22** (recommended): soundboard; 22 songs; 101 min [1]. Said about its sound: Backup FOB recording was rough due to wind [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: charlie background, no children, shallow, violent [1]\n- The band paused performance briefly after this song [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2026-05-22**: taped by Kyle Kennelly & Emerald Green; transferred by Kyle Kennelly; source: SBD > PCM-A10 + Tascam FR-AV2 > DPA4060s (Healy On Stage) [1]. Also: Uploader used stage capture with windscreens for windy outdoor conditions [1]",
